ld&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/kstenerud/dogma&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;dogma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;66 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1&lt;br&gt;Dogma: A modernized metalanguage with better expressiveness and binary grammar support&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;I guess you&#39;d call me a software inventor. I like to come up with new tools and new ways of doing things that folks didn&#39;t even know were possible.&lt;/p&gt; 
